    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "MiCOM C264"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "Robust and ready for system integration, MiCOM C264 is dedicated to smart management of electrical installations. It leverages the future-proof IEC 61850 standard and communicates with multiple IEDs, gateways, and local HMI/SCADA.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "When equipped with predefined automation schemes, MiCOM C264 performs automatic transfer of source, synchronism check, automatic voltage regulation, generator control, and power synchronizer.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "MiCOM C264 also:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "Is a One Box Solution with MV feeder protection features",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "Can be connected to Smart Terminal Blocks and distributed I/Os",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Is synchronized from IRIG-B signals, SNTP, PTP (IEEE 1588-2008) or from the control center",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "Interfaces with EcoStruxure Power Device App for nearby monitoring",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "It embeds cybersecurity and complies with IEC 62351-8 (RBAC), Sys Logs, Radius. With the System, MiCOM C264 is IEC 62443-3-3 certified.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "Spare Parts Services: 10 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "MiCOM C264 Bay Controller, MiCOM C264 RTU and MiCOM C264P applications contribute to:",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Maximize energy availability",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Simplify the control and monitoring of electrical assets",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Improve security of operations in electrical networks",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "Accelerate project delivery with pre-packaged engineering",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "Optimize the TCO – Total Cost of Ownership on electrical installations",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:92",
    "text": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:93",
    "text": "MiCOM C264 is a bay controller, RTU, AVR, OBS with feeder protection, load shedding unit, and generator controller for new installations and retrofits - with local services and support over the entire MiCOM C264 lifecycle:",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:94",
    "text": "Electrical bay panels",
    "heading": "Applications"
  },
  {
